    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d645">

                <pb facs="0781" n="689" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg689"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/10034</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Curtis</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-16T10:00:00-05:48">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 16, 1918, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received May 17, 6.25 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In the course of a conversation yesterday afternoon I intimated to the President
                    that the position of Honduras as to claims by Germany after the war would be
                    stronger if it declared war and he said <pb facs="0782" n="690" xml:id="pg690"/>
                    that he was only awaiting the return of the Minister for Foreign Affairs who has
                    been ill for about two months to ask for a report as to the international law on
                    the subject. I suggest that you have prepared and send me a memorandum along
                    these lines citing authorities with editions and pages.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
